Error [jet.MissingMoveMarker]: `s` cannot be moved from borrowed storage
  --> tests/ui/move_from_borrowed_argument.jet:25:13
    |
 25 |     consume(s)
    |             ^
 Why: `s` is a read or write parameter, so its caller keeps the value; moving it here would copy it
 Fix: Write `s.copy()` when `consume` should receive a copy, or declare the parameter `s: &&Session` so the caller hands the value over
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0201

Error [jet.MissingMoveMarker]: `s` cannot be moved from borrowed storage
  --> tests/ui/move_from_borrowed_argument.jet:29:16
    |
 29 |     sink(slot, s)
    |                ^
 Why: `s` is a read or write parameter, so its caller keeps the value; moving it here would copy it
 Fix: Write `s.copy()` when `sink` should receive a copy, or declare the parameter `s: &&Session` so the caller hands the value over
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0201

Error [jet.MissingMoveMarker]: `view` cannot be moved from borrowed storage
  --> tests/ui/move_from_borrowed_argument.jet:34:13
    |
 34 |     consume(view)
    |             ^^^^
 Why: `view` reads its value through a view of the place it was bound to, so that place keeps the value; moving it here would copy it
 Fix: Write `view.copy()` when `consume` should receive a copy, or move the place itself with `.move()` when this scope owns it
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0201

